The following were rewritten in JavaScript for this app, with changes for
VISCA cameras and this app's design:
  - the follow-shot framing rules and their numbers (src/main/tracking/framing.js)
  - the routing page and operator routing buttons (src/main/store/routing.js,
    frontend/src/components/RoutingView.jsx, RoutePanel.jsx)
  - camera picture measurements for exposure matching (frontend/src/colourMatch.js)
  - finding devices on the network, including the ATEM hello packet
    (src/main/tools/finder.js)
  - keeping a last-good copy of the settings (src/main/store/settings.js)

